<title>MEXICO: Mexico TIIE interbank rate falls for Sept 10.</title>
<headline>Mexico TIIE interbank rate falls for Sept 10.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's TIIE or &quot;equilibrium&quot; 28-day interbank interest rate for Tuesday fell 26.5 basis points to 26.41 percent from 26.675 percent September 9, the Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289562</p>
